\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T16:58:20-07:00","id":1249576,"title":"","content":"We've release another Changeling interview this week: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/episode-8-c20-interview-with-charlie-cantrell\" target=\"_blank\">http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/episo...arlie-cantrell</a><br /> <br /> This time, we had the pleasure to talk to Charlie Cantrell, also known as Pooka Knight! We talked about the experience moving from fan to developer and more about why we love Changeling.<br /> <br /> We'd love to get your feedback! You can find us on facebook or reach out by email to <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#f084989583849f8289849f9c94809f9493918384b0979d91999cde939f9d\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"fd8995988e89928f84899291998d92999e9c8e89bd9a909c9491d39e9290\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T17:06:56-07:00","id":1249578,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1240850-c20-developer-interview?p=1248361#post1248361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you have any transcripts?</div> </div> </div> </div>We'd be happy to work with someone if they'd like to volunteer to create transcripts. At this time, it's not something we have time to do ourselves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T04:36:26-07:00","id":1249931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1240850-c20-developer-interview?p=1249578#post1249578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We'd be happy to work with someone if they'd like to volunteer to create transcripts. At this time, it's not something we have time to do ourselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a good idea. I know there's software that does this, too (it's imperfect, but can be helpful). Hopefully a fan somewhere will do it. I just know a couple of people who, for various reasons, prefer transcripts (mainly my best friend, who's partially deaf).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-10T08:17:27-07:00","id":1253066,"title":"","content":"We've passed the halfway mark for the Changeling series! In this episode, we review Kithbook Boggans and the Book of Freeholds.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/episode-9\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://assets.libsyn.com/content/23145258?height=250&amp;width=250&amp;overlay=true\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/episode-9\" target=\"_blank\"> The Story Told RPG Podcast: Episode 9 C20 Kithbook Boggans and Book of Freeholds Review </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/episode-9\" target=\"_blank\"> http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/episode-9 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> In this episode, we review some of the supplements released for Changeling the Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition. The Book of Freeholds offers a deep dive into the secret places of the fae and Kithbook Boggans completes the original cycle of Kithbooks. We also highlight the C20 Ready-Made Characters. You can find Changeling the Dreaming on DrivethruRPG: Our music is composed by James Horan. To contact him regarding composition, send him an email:&amp;nbsp; To help support the show, you can donate through PayPal. We'll use the donation to pay our artists and cover hosting costs for the show. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Jo